88:           "policy": "Each fisher may keep up to 1.2 units of fish per day; any excess must be deposited in the communal reserve. Consumption, deposits, withdrawals, and violations are recorded on a shared ledger signed by the cook, and the steward enforces deposits, penalties, and suspension rules with a council vote requiring a simple majority.",
